---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<!-- Placeholder. Replaced by the eight home sections in Task 9.
     `rights` is set here only so the token/conjunct check renders untranslated. -->
<Base title="मेरा हक़" rights>
  <main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl p-6 pt-16">
    <h2 class="shirorekha text-app-display font-bold text-ink">टोकन जाँच</h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-app-title">स्त्रीधन · ज़िंदगी · हक़ · काग़ज़</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-app-title font-bold">स्त्रीधन · ज़िंदगी · हक़ · काग़ज़</p>

    <p class="mono mt-4 text-blue-600">181 · 15100 · 14454</p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      Montserrat Latin next to <span>खाता खोलें</span> — seam check. PMJDY खाता आज खोलें।
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6">
      Mixed weight: यह <span class="emph">हक़</span> आपका है — Latin <span class="emph">emphasis</span> too.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <span class="rounded-action bg-pink-600 px-4 py-3 text-surface">pink-600 action</span>
      <span class="rounded-action bg-blue-600 px-4 py-3 text-surface">blue-600 sarkari</span>
      <span class="rounded-none border-s-[3px] border-green-700 bg-green-050 px-4 py-3 text-green-700">
        सही है
      </span>
      <span class="rounded-none border-s-[3px] border-red-700 bg-red-050 px-4 py-3 text-red-700">
        यह सही नहीं है
      </span>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
